        "id": 1395927
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-02-01T15:57:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I was under impression the values needed justification (miscommunication).\nThe only point I actually want to discuss is as this define is not used in EC but only in kernel, if it would not be better to drop this define and instead of\nwdd-\u003emax_timeout \u003d EC_HANG_DETECT_MAX_TIMEOUT;\nuse\nwdd-\u003emax_timeout \u003d U16_MAX;\n\nhttps://patchwork.kernel.org/project/linux-watchdog/patch/20240126095721.782782-3-lma@chromium.org/",
      "parentUuid": "4ff62232_47216fe3",
      "range": {
